'''Khazad-dûm''' is a location in the [[Crystal Hollows]] within the {{Zone|Magma Fields}} where the [[Topaz Crystal]] can be obtained. 

{{ZoneText|Deep below the Misty Mountains lies the shadow and flame guarding ancient treasure...}}

== Purpose ==
'''Khazad-dûm''' is home to {{MobSprite|Bal}}, a [[Bosses|boss]] which spawns periodically in the center. After the boss sinks into the ground, the {{Item|Topaz Crystal}} will spawn close-by and become claimable.

== Trivia ==
*When using the {{Item|Wishing Compass}} in the {{Zone|Magma Fields}}, it points towards the '''Khazad-dûm'''.
*'''Khazad-dûm''' is a reference to a [https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/Khazad-dûm place of the same name] in J. R. R. Tolkien's ''The Lord of the Rings''.

